==Battleground==
===<u>Chapter 1</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Zoge|Zroco|Doge Dark|Zapy|Dread Bore}}
*3 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6~6.67 seconds<sup>180f~200f</sup>.
*3 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6~6.67 seconds<sup>180f~200f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dread Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Zapy]] spawns.

===<u>Chapter 2</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Shibalien|Zroco|Wild Doge|Shibalien Elite|Zory|Nimoy Bore}}
*3 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 8~11.33 seconds<sup>240f~340f</sup>.
*1 [[Wild Doge]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Wild Doge]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

===<u>Chapter 3</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Doge Dark|Zoge|Shibalien|Zory|Dread Bore|Nimoy Bore}}
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Dread Bore]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

