==='''Chapter 3'''===
This is risky, but luring close to your base and using Holy Blast when Dread Bore burrows will make managing the Deploy Limit a lot easier. With some Research Combos, [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong]] will be your main meatshield. You'll want to use [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer]] to keep Nimoy Bore in place, while you whale on both Bores with [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard]], [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] (or [[The Invisible Cat (Special Cat)|Groom Cat]] also works if you have it), and [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife]] (who is only useful if you have her [[Savage Blow]] talent unlocked). With this much focused DPS, it's wise to bring [[Ancient Egg: N107 (Rare Cat)|Cat Chief]] (optimally) or some other [[Soulstrike]] Unit to help clean up corpses.

