==Trivia==
*Uranus's base looks like an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] version of the "[https://cdn.clipkit.co/tenants/1415/item_images/images/001/613/206/medium/ed48d45a-1828-4914-846e-7cecc3f6306a.gif?1681105846 Uranus]" robot from [[wikipedia:ja:マーズ (漫画)|''Mars'']], a relatively obscure manga by [[wikipedia:Mitsuteru Yokoyama|Mitsuteru Yokoyama]]. Note that in the OVA, the US government refers to this bot as just "Daruma", while in ''[[wikipedia:Giant Robo: The Day the Earth Stood Still|Giant Robo: The Day the Earth Stood Still]]'', it is renamed to Weranus.
**While the overall color scheme isn't alike, Uranus does have a yellow eye like the stage's base, as seen [https://youtu.be/EwwdSHXA8-s here].

